      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.72,
      "end_seconds": 15.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "how are things, what's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 17.12,
      "end_seconds": 23.33,
      "duration_seconds": 6.21,
      "text": "Doctor um it's heartburn most days. That's what we're worried about."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.96,
      "end_seconds": 28.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "what's the timeline when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.01,
      "end_seconds": 33.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "okay, so it's been going on for three weeks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.76,
      "end_seconds": 45.16,
      "duration_seconds": 10.4,
      "text": "tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it it better or worse"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.73,
      "end_seconds": 56.44,
      "duration_seconds": 9.71,
      "text": "yes, lying flat. That That makes it worse. I get some relief from antacids. It's a couple of times a week"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.56,
      "end_seconds": 64.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "okay, any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.3,
      "end_seconds": 70.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "It It usually comes with food sticking sometimes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.68,
      "end_seconds": 75.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "How strong would you say it is?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.85,
      "end_seconds": 79.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.07,
      "text": "Moderate, really"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.46,
      "end_seconds": 81.3,
      "duration_seconds": 0.84,
      "text": "Mm-hmm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.29,
      "end_seconds": 86.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "and a sour taste, too"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 95.67,
      "end_seconds": 104.67,
      "duration_seconds": 9.0,
      "text": "Here are the numbers doctor. BP is 113 over 76 SpO2 99 percent on room air heart rate 81. Temperature is 36.7 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.6,
      "end_seconds": 106.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.01,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.74,
      "end_seconds": 130.0,
      "duration_seconds": 5.26,
      "text": "let me check a few things. Any vomiting, weight loss or black stools?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.28,
      "end_seconds": 137.11,
      "duration_seconds": 5.83,
      "text": "I haven't had vomiting, weight loss or black stools, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.61,
      "end_seconds": 140.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Nothing like chest pain on exertion?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.87,
      "end_seconds": 148.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "No. No chest pain on exertion."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.5,
      "end_seconds": 153.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "I see go ahead. And your skin any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.11,
      "end_seconds": 156.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "No, skin's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.31,
      "end_seconds": 165.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Any pins and needles or loss of strength anywhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.29,
      "end_seconds": 168.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "No weakness or anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.69,
      "end_seconds": 171.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "and alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.65,
      "end_seconds": 176.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.86,
      "end_seconds": 181.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.78,
      "end_seconds": 188.81,
      "duration_seconds": 6.03,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.63,
      "end_seconds": 191.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "who lives with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.25,
      "end_seconds": 195.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "My partner and our baby"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.0,
      "end_seconds": 198.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Right what's your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.97,
      "end_seconds": 204.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.66,
      "end_seconds": 207.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "tell me your medicines, please"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.29,
      "end_seconds": 214.83,
      "duration_seconds": 6.54,
      "text": "Pantoprazole 40 milligrams before breakfast. Apixaban. I take it 5 milligrams twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 216.43,
      "end_seconds": 224.16,
      "duration_seconds": 7.73,
      "text": "He is supposed to take it twice a day, but I can't say he always does."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.24,
      "end_seconds": 229.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Is there anything relevant on the family side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.56,
      "end_seconds": 238.67,
      "duration_seconds": 5.11,
      "text": "I mean my brother has epilepsy. My son has asthma"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.03,
      "end_seconds": 247.88,
      "duration_seconds": 7.85,
      "text": "any health conditions I should have on record? I ask because it it helps me narrow things down"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 249.48,
      "end_seconds": 256.84,
      "duration_seconds": 7.36,
      "text": "Acid reflux, for nearly five years. I've had an irregular heartbeat for about ten years now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.82,
      "end_seconds": 260.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "any other things?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.19,
      "end_seconds": 269.74,
      "duration_seconds": 8.55,
      "text": "yes, an irregular heartbeat is known to us, good to have that clear. Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 271.04,
      "end_seconds": 273.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "not to my knowledge, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 274.28,
      "end_seconds": 280.66,
      "duration_seconds": 6.38,
      "text": "Hold on, doctor, I think he reacted to erythromycin once. I'm not certain, though."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 281.79,
      "end_seconds": 285.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "maybe but I don't recall it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.94,
      "end_seconds": 293.78,
      "duration_seconds": 7.84,
      "text": "alright, so that's unclear i'll record what each of you said anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 295.61,
      "end_seconds": 298.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Just a bunion operation six years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.53,
      "end_seconds": 326.16,
      "duration_seconds": 14.63,
      "text": "so based on your history I can't pin this down yet we're looking at reflux with a swallowing symptom that needs a camera test or a narrowing of the gullet"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 327.24,
      "end_seconds": 329.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.87,
      "end_seconds": 367.49,
      "duration_seconds": 36.62,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's reflux with a swallowing symptom that needs a camera test, and we'll know more once the an endoscopy is back. Let's book an endoscopy to look into dysphagia and reflux. I'm sending you for a blood count because of reflux. Eat smaller meals and avoid eating for three hours before bed. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 367.99,
      "end_seconds": 375.43,
      "duration_seconds": 7.44,
      "text": "the gastroenterology clinic would be the right next step, I'll refer you. We'll catch up after the endoscopy"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 375.96,
      "end_seconds": 379.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "I'll note it in my calendar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 380.54,
      "end_seconds": 383.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 384.9,
      "end_seconds": 387.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks"
    }
